@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy policy";
}

<h1>Privacy policy</h1>

<p><em>Silk &amp; Loom OEM scarf studio - effective January 2026</em></p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Order data:</strong> name, shipping address, email, phone, order contents.</li>
    <li><strong>Payment tokens:</strong> gateway references only (Stripe/PayPal); never card numbers.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> anonymous analytics about pages viewed and device type.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How we use it</h2>
<p>To fulfill orders, provide tracking updates, handle returns and claims, prevent fraud, and -
only with your consent - send marketing email. We do not sell personal information.</p>

<h2>Who we share it with</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Carriers (UPS, FedEx, USPS, or your chosen custom carrier) - address and phone for delivery.</li>
    <li>Payment processors (Stripe, PayPal) - amount and order reference.</li>
    <li>Infrastructure providers (Microsoft Azure) - hosting, under contractual confidentiality.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Retention and your rights</h2>
<p>Order records are kept for 7 years for tax purposes; marketing consents until withdrawn.
You may request access, correction, export, or deletion of your data at
<a href="mailto:privacy@example.com">privacy@example.com</a>. California residents have
additional rights under CCPA; EU/UK residents under GDPR (we rely on contract performance
and legitimate interest as legal bases).</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>Essential cookies keep your session and cart. Analytics cookies are optional and can be
declined without affecting checkout.</p>
